{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54593","headline":"兵要望江南 占虹霓第七（京本作「占虹第九」○十一首） 二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占虹霓第七（京本作「占虹第九」○十一首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵行次，虹贯日（京本作「路」）边傍。\n御（京本作「预」）备伏兵前有阻，且须审细自（京本作「更」）商量，移寨避灾殃（辛本、川本、京本作「终不得开疆」）。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}